<title>USA: Olin Corp sets quarterly dividend $0.30.</title>
<headline>Olin Corp sets quarterly dividend $0.30.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.30		   $0.60</p>
<p> Pay	     Dec 10</p>
<p> Record	  Nov 8</p>
<p>NOTE: The figure for the latest quarterly dividend pertains to each share of the company's post-split common stock.</p>
<p>Olin split its common stock on a two-for-one basis effective October 31.</p>
